OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will get off to a rather
OL,6,Fcloudy start with showery outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain. The showers will become more
OL,8,Fscattered during the day, allowing
OL,9,Fsome bright to sunny spells to develop
OL,10,Fat times. Feeling warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine, though breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOne or two showers will
OL,14,Fcontinue during the evening and into
OL,15,Fthe overnight period, though for many
OL,16,Fit will become dry. Clear spells
OL,17,Fdeveloping. A mild, though rather
OL,18,Fbreezy night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,167,160,301,260,100,100
