OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAn isolated light shower is
OL,6,Fstill possible on Monday, especially
OL,7,Fin the morning. Most areas will have a
OL,8,Ffine day though with bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Warm in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThough
OL,12,Fthe odd shower cannot be ruled out
OL,13,Fduring the period, most places should
OL,14,Fhold onto fine weather. Temperatures
OL,15,Fwill creep up again, so feeling hotter
OL,16,Fin lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
